% ============================================================================
% precipitation-alternate-form.query — worked recall queries against
% precipitation-alternate-form.adj (adj-facts-stdlib, METEOROLOGY).
% ============================================================================
% Three queries: forward recall with citation, backward recall (bind a
% form, find the precipitation type), and honest abstention on rain (this
% table only grounds the one precipitation type whose cited span lists
% more than one descriptive term).
% ============================================================================

import "precipitation-alternate-form.adj"

% Forward: what alternate form does the cited NWS sentence list for hail?
? precipitation_alternate_form(hail, $Form)

% Backward: which precipitation type is described as irregular pellets?
? precipitation_alternate_form($Precip, irregular_pellets)

% Honest abstention: rain's cited span names only one descriptive term, no listed alternatives.
? precipitation_alternate_form(rain, $FormRain)
